f=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hv</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">WordArray.LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">vs</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">v₂ </span><span class=\"fn\">dv</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Divides limbs `0` to `i + n - 1` of `w` by `v` of `n` limbs, with the top limbs `v₁` and `v₂`,\nfrom window `i - 1` down to window `0`, in place: the quotient limb of window `j` goes to limb\n`j + n`, so that the quotient ends in limbs `n` to `n + i - 1` and the remainder in limbs `0` to\n`n - 1`.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.divLoopIn","kind":"def","line":1800,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.divLoopIn","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L1800-L1815"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.divStep2In\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">divStep2In</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">w </span><span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">vs </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hv</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">WordArray.LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">vs</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">v₂ </span><span class=\"fn\">v₃ </span><span class=\"fn\">dv</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Two steps of the division at once for the window of `n + 2` limbs of `w` from limb `i`: the\nestimate `qEst2R` of its two quotient limbs from its top five limbs and the top three of `v`, then\n`divStep2Core`, or, when the checks of the estimate fail or `v` has two limbs, `divStepIn` for the\nwindow from limb `i + 1` and then for the one from limb `i`. Afterwards limbs `i` to `i + n - 1`\nhold the remainder of the window by `v` and limbs `i + n` and `i + n + 1` its two quotient limbs.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.divStep2In","kind":"def","line":1640,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.divStep2In","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L1640-L1660"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.top5\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">top5</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hn</span> : <span class=\"fn\">3</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hU</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize.size\">USize.size</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">3</span>)).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">3</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of the fifth limb from the top of a window of `n + 2 ≥ 5` limbs.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.top5","kind":"theorem","line":1632,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.top5","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L1632-L1638"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.toNat_three\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">toNat_three</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">USize.toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">3</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">3</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.toNat_three","kind":"theorem","line":1629,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.toNat_three","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L1629-L1630"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.divStep2Core\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">divStep2Core</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">w </span><span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">vs </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hv</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">WordArray.LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">vs</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hk</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.WinB2\">WinB2</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">q₀ </span><span class=\"fn\">q₁</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Two steps of the division at once, without allocating, from the estimate `q₀ + β q₁` of the two\nquotient limbs of the window of `n + 2` limbs of `w` from limb `i`: subtracts `v (q₀ + β q₁)` from\nlimbs `i` to `i + n - 1` by one pass of `subMul2Step`, and when the borrow out equals the top two\nlimbs `i + n` and `i + n + 1` of the window, the common case of an exact estimate, writes the\nquotient limbs there. Otherwise the window went negative and `addBack2` corrects it.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.divStep2Core","kind":"def","line":1436,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.divStep2Core","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L1436-L1463"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.divStepIn\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">divStepIn</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">w </span><span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">vs </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hv</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">WordArray.LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">vs</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">v₂ </span><span class=\"fn\">dv</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One step of the division, without allocating: subtracts `q v`, for the estimate `q`, from limbs\n`i` to `i + n - 1` of `w` by the in-place fold, and when the borrow out equals the top limb\n`i + n` of the window, which is then the common case of an exact estimate, writes `q` there.\nOtherwise the window went negative and `addBack` corrects it. Afterwards limbs `i` to `i + n - 1`\nhold the remainder of the window by `v` and limb `i + n` the quotient limb.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.divStepIn","kind":"def","line":1270,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.divStepIn","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L1270-L1294"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.top3\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">top3</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hn</span> : <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hU</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize.size\">USize.size</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>   <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>)).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span>)).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The indices of the top three limbs of a window of `n + 1 ≥ 3` limbs.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.top3","kind":"theorem","line":1257,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.top3","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L1257-L1268"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.toNat_two\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">toNat_two</span