</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The estimate is never too small: every `Q < β` with `Q (v₁ β + v₂) ≤ w₂ β² + w₁ β + w₀` is at most\n`qEst w₂ w₁ w₀ v₁ v₂`.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.qEst_ge","kind":"theorem","line":142,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.qEst_ge","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L142-L193"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.qEst\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">qEst</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">w₂ </span><span class=\"fn\">w₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">w₀ </span><span class=\"fn\">v₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">v₂</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">L</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The estimate of the quotient limb of `w₂ β² + w₁ β + w₀` by `v₁ β + v₂`, from the quotient `q` of\n`w₂ β + w₁` by `v₁`, decreased at most twice while `q (v₁ β + v₂)` exceeds the dividend, as in\nAlgorithm D; `β - 1` when `w₂ ≥ v₁`.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.qEst","kind":"def","line":123,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.qEst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Div/Schoolbook.lean#L123-L140"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.html#MPN.Schoolbook.gt2\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Schoolbook</span>.<span class=\"name\">gt2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h </span><span class=\"fn\">l </span><span class=\"fn\">r </span><span class=\"fn\">w₀</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `q v₂ > r β + w₀` for the limb `r`, where `h β + l = q v₂`: a comparison of double limbs.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Schoolbook.htm